Description: |
  Shared, cross-cutting relabeling engine. Confirmed by import-graph analysis to be consumed
  identically by `lib/promscrape` (target and per-sample metric relabeling during scraping) and
  by app/vminsert's and app/vmagent's own `relabel`/`remotewrite` subpackages (remote-write
